Package: rEquityTool
Title: Wealth Scores and Wealth Quintiles from 'EquityTool' Questionnaires
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R:
    person("Nicholus", "Tint Zaw", , "n.t.zaw@cgiar.org", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Reads the country workbooks published by the 'EquityTool'
    (<https://equitytool.org>), a simplified asset-based measure of relative
    household wealth derived from Demographic and Health Survey and Multiple
    Indicator Cluster Survey wealth indices, and applies them to survey data.
    Given a data frame of respondent answers, the package computes the
    'EquityTool' wealth score and assigns respondents to wealth quintiles using
    the published national, urban or rural cut-points, or using the sample's own
    weighted score distribution when relative position within the surveyed
    population is the quantity of interest. Response coding is validated before
    scoring, and score tables are cross-checked against the two independent
    representations of them in each workbook.
